[EN] Confirms active quality monitoring of the planning work. §4.7.1 (target state): a phase-by-phase check is laid down in a quality-assurance plan covering both self- and third-party monitoring. Shown only when the contract with the planner / engineering office is concluded (phase_auftrag_erteilt = yes, this sheet) – § 4.7.1 (p. 34): "the quality monitoring of the planning services is not regulated by contract." Before the contract there is no commissioned planning service whose quality would have to be monitored; REQ-18 then does not apply yet.$m$,
