[EN] Date of this record. A plain record field. Shown only when the phase "execution" is reached (phase_ausfuehrung_erreicht = yes, 820-2-20): construction changes arise in the construction phase – § 5.6.4 (p. 53): "frequently it is regarded as necessary in the phase of construction to change plans on site at the construction site."$m$,
